  x invalid capability name `Shell|Tools`
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-component/components/core/unlisted/component.kdl:7:10]
 6 | flies "a kite"
 7 | provides "Shell|Tools"
   :          ^^^^^^|^^^^^^
